    {
      "id": "sum-362ddb",
      "kind": "evolution",
      "body": "The 2024 rewrite in #2115 / PR #2125 is the wording change that matters. tghosth split three overlapping SSRF controls: this requirement kept allowlist validation of data used to call another service, file metadata moved to what is now V5.3.2, and the sanitization-versus-validation terminology was argued in thread. The March 2025 renumber to V1.3.6 was chapter restructure, not a change of meaning. Level also moved from L1 to L2.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "type": "issue_body",
          "url": "https://github.com/OWASP/ASVS/issues/2115",
          "issue": 2115
        },
        {
          "type": "pr_body",
